# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenAlex-DH-analysis — .gitignore
#
# Principle: track everything needed to REPRODUCE the analysis (code, renv.lock,
# small result tables). Exclude only what is (a) regenerable by a script in R/,
# (b) machine-local, or (c) too large for git to handle sanely.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- R session cruft -------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj.user
.httr-oauth
*_cache/
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md

# --- renv ------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: renv.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins package versions and is
# the single most important file for reproducibility here. Commit it, and
# re-commit it whenever you renv::snapshot().
renv/library/
renv/local/
renv/cellar/
renv/lock/
renv/python/
renv/sandbox/
renv/staging/

# --- editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.posit/
Thumbs.db

# --- Claude Code -----------------------------------------------------------
# Worktrees are full checkouts — never commit them. CLAUDE.md at repo root
# stays tracked (it is project documentation and useful to collaborators).
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/plans/
.claude/todos/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.md

# --- large derived data ----------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable via the numbered scripts in R/. Excluded because git handles
# large binaries badly and GitHub rejects files over 100 MB.
data/raw/
data/snapshot/
data/cache/
**/cache/
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.rds
*.gz
*.bz2
*.zip
*.tar

# Index of DH Conferences extract (CMU, ~70 MB). Not redistributed here — see
# README "Conference pipeline" for the download; script 13 reads it from here.
data/dh_conferences_data/

# Journal-corpus intermediates regenerable from data/02_dh_corpus_full.rds
data/02_dh_corpus.csv
data/03_referenced_work_ids.txt
data/04_cited_works_checkpoint.rds

# The two retrieved OpenAlex inputs script 03 needs are tracked on purpose:
# OpenAlex changes daily, so re-running 01-02 would not reproduce the paper's
# numbers exactly. Retrieval date is in data/00_retrieval_date.txt.
!data/02_dh_corpus_full.rds

# --- paper / talk build artefacts ------------------------------------------
eadh2026/*.aux
eadh2026/*.bbl
eadh2026/*.bcf
eadh2026/*.blg
eadh2026/*.log
eadh2026/*.out
eadh2026/*.run.xml
eadh2026/*.synctex.gz
eadh2026/eadh2026_talk_preview.pdf
eadh2026/eadh2026_talk.pptx
eadh2026/slides/
eadh2026/figures/
eadh2026/talk_speaker_notes.md

# --- credentials -----------------------------------------------------------
.Renviron
.env
*.pem
*_secret*
